---
const { contained = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class:list={["studio-commission", { contained }]} aria-labelledby="commission-title">
  <div>
    <p class="studio-kicker">A focused engineering pilot</p>
    <h2 id="commission-title">Verify one AI-built feature before release.</h2>
    <p>
      AI agents inspect one critical workflow in a TypeScript/Node application,
      run reproducible checks, and write a report of defects and verification
      limits. Sarthak is the contact for scope and payment. The pilot is $500 USD:
      $250 to start and $250 on delivery, within three
      working days after we agree the scope and runnable setup. Fixes are separately
      scoped. <a href="/evidence/feature-verification-anime-list-2026-10-02.md">Read a real sample report</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <a
    class="studio-commission-email"
    href="mailto:team@sassmaker.com?subject=%24500%20feature%20verification%20pilot"
  >
    <span>Discuss a $500 pilot</span>
    <strong>team@sassmaker.com</strong>
    <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
  </a>
</section>

<style>
  .studio-commission.contained {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    gap: 1rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .contained .studio-kicker {
    font: 400 .75rem/1.5 var(--fleet-footer-label-font, ui-monospace, monospace);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
  }
  .studio-commission.contained h2 {
    max-width: 30ch;
    margin-top: .5rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
  }
  .studio-commission.contained > div > p:last-child {
    margin-top: .75rem;
    color: inherit;
    font-size: .875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .contained .studio-commission-email {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .5rem .75rem;
    min-height: 44px;
    width: fit-content;
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: .5rem 0;
    border: 0;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: .2em;
  }
  .contained .studio-commission-email > span:first-child {
    color: inherit;
    font: 400 .75rem/1.5 var(--fleet-footer-label-font, ui-monospace, monospace);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
  }
  .contained .studio-commission-email strong {
    font-size: .9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .contained .studio-commission-email > span:last-child {
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .contained .studio-commission-email:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
</style>
